cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Flexion: evidence-graded remote musculoskeletal movement screening (research prototype)"
abstract: >-
  Browser-based research prototype for remote musculoskeletal movement
  screening. On-device pose estimation (MediaPipe) scores a guided movement
  routine, and every score carries a literature-derived evidence tier
  (High / Moderate / Exploratory). Not a validated or approved medical
  device; not for clinical use.
